            "text": "{\"title\":\"Morning Masala Spiced Egg and Sprouted Moong Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":30,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This savory \u003cb\u003emorning masala sprouted moong stew\u003c/b\u003e offers a vibrant Indian breakfast experience designed to kickstart your day with warmth and balanced nutrition. Traditionally served during quiet morning hours across Western India, this hearty dish combines high-protein sprouted green gram with aromatic spices to deliver a rich, comforting meal that digests easily. The base relies on fragrant \u003cb\u003emustard oil\u003c/b\u003e, tempered cumin, aromatic ginger, and garlic, creating a deeply layered broth complemented by sweet plum tomatoes. To adapt this rustic stew for early morning fuel, it is finished with soft eggs that add a velvety richness when cut into, blending seamlessly with the warm \u003cb\u003egaram masala\u003c/b\u003e spice blend. Each bowl provides impressive amounts of dietary fiber, essential vitamins, and plant-based protein without feeling heavy. Serving this dish alongside toasted flatbread or enjoying it as a standalone warm bowl makes for a comforting routine. Bright coriander herbs added at the end lend a crisp freshness that balances the rich notes of the stew. Whether you are looking for a wholesome alternative to sweet morning porridges or seeking an authentic taste of coastal Indian homestyle cooking, this versatile stew delivers incredible flavor, comforting textures, and sustaining energy for your entire day.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":350.0,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":17.5},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":14.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21.5},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":3.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":17.5},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":42.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":14.0},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":6.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6.7},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":18.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36.0},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":185.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":61.7},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":520.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":22.6},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":9.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin A\",\"amount\":650.0,\"unit\":\"IU\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin C\",\"amount\":28.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":31.1},{\"name\":\"Vitamin D\",\"amount\":40.0,\"unit\":\"IU\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6.7},{\"name\":\"Vitamin E\",\"amount\":2.1,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":14.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin K\",\"amount\":24.0,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":20.0},{\"name\":\"Thiamin\",\"amount\":0.3,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":25.0},{\"name\":\"Riboflavin\",\"amount\":0.4,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":30.8},{\"name\":\"Niacin\",\"amount\":3.2,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":20.0},{\"name\":\"Pantothenic Acid\",\"amount\":1.1,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":22.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin B6\",\"amount\":0.5,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":29.4},{\"name\":\"Folate\",\"amount\":140.0,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":35.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin B12\",\"amount\":0.8,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":33.3},{\"name\":\"Calcium\",\"amount\":110.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":8.5},{\"name\":\"Iron\",\"amount\":4.2,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":23.3},{\"name\":\"Potassium\",\"amount\":620.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13.2},{\"name\":\"Magnesium\",\"amount\":85.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":20.2},{\"name\":\"Phosphorus\",\"amount\":210.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":16.8},{\"name\":\"Zinc\",\"amount\":2.4,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21.8},{\"name\":\"Copper\",\"amount\":0.4,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":44.4},{\"name\":\"Manganese\",\"amount\":0.8,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfD